  '1 tsp curry powder': 'Loso lo lonnye lo le 1 lwa phofo ya kheri',
  'Salt and black pepper to taste': 'Letswai le pepere e ntsho go ya ka tatso',
  'Cover the soaked beans with fresh water, bring to a boil, then simmer uncovered for 45-55 minutes until a bean crushes easily between your fingers. Keep a cup of the cooking water.': 'Khurumetsa dinawa tse di inetsweng ka metsi a mašwa, di bedise, mme o di bedise ka iketlo kwa ntle ga sekhurumelo metsotso e le 45-55 go fitlha nawa e pitlagana motlhofo magareng ga menwana. Boloka kopi ya metsi a go apaya.',
  'In a second pot, heat the oil over medium heat and cook the onion for 6-8 minutes until soft and golden.': 'Mo pitseng ya bobedi, mothofatsa oli mo molelong wa bogare mme o apee eie metsotso e le 6-8 go fitlha e le bonolo e bile e le gauta.',
  'Stir in the garlic and curry powder and cook for 30 seconds, just until fragrant.': 'Fudua konofolo le phofo ya kheri mme o apee metsotsonyana e le 30, go fitlha go nkga monate.',
  'Add the grated tomato and simmer for 8 minutes until it darkens into a thick gravy.': 'Oketsa tamati e e gratilweng mme o bedise ka iketlo metsotso e le 8 go fitlha e fifala e nna moro o o tiileng.',
  'Fold in the drained beans with a splash of the reserved water. Simmer for 10 minutes so the beans take on the gravy, then season and serve over pap or rice.': 'Tsenya dinawa tse di tshololweng metsi le metsi a mannye a o a bolokileng. Bedisa ka iketlo metsotso e le 10 gore dinawa di tseye moro, mme o tshele dinoko o fe le bogobe kgotsa raese.',
  'Brown Lentils': 'Dilentile tse Ditshotlho',
