  'Add the garlic and bay leaf, stirring for 30 seconds.': 'Oketsa konofolo le letlhare la bay, o fudue metsotsonyana e le 30.',
  'Tip in the lentils and water, bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer covered for 20-25 minutes until tender but not mushy.': 'Tshela dilentile le metsi, bedisa, mme o fokotse molelo o bedise ka iketlo o khurumeditse metsotso e le 20-25 go fitlha di le bonolo mme di sa pitlagana.',
  'Remove the bay leaf, season generously, and mash a few spoonfuls against the side of the pot to thicken the broth.': 'Ntsha letlhare la bay, tshela dinoko sentle, mme o pitle maso a le mmalwa fa thoko ga pitsa go tiisa moro.',
